{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"873108970162782298","content":"\"This mortal being, from this family... Is trying to reach out to you... Regardless of what or who they have become... The same heart, and same mind are in a body... And that body, wants to see you.\" Bo clears his throat. \"Someome that looked up to you, and you are turning your back?\"","created_at":"2021-08-06T08:38:49.610000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873122935278276628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"873108970162782298","content":"\"I did not forget about Daniel. You are a bold individual to accuse me of such. We fought hard for what we have here. It is not yours to judge.\" Fiona spits on the ground near you following this remark.","created_at":"2021-08-06T08:39:20.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873123065352052746","reply_to_id":"873122305289633823","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
